solution.p:
And the sum of lifting all of the slices from the bottom (x=0) to the top of the water level's depth (x=5) is
\begin{array}{cl}
\int_0^{5}(9.8)(1030)\left({\frac{1}{9}} \pi x^2\right)(6-x)\,dx  \amp  =10094\left({\frac{1}{9}}\right)\pi\int_0^{5} (6 x^2-x^3)\,dx \\
  \amp    =10094\left({\frac{1}{9}}\right)\pi\left[\frac{6 x^3}{3} - \frac{x^4}{4}\right]_0^{5}  \\
  \amp    =10094\left({\frac{1}{9}}\right)\pi\big[250-{\frac{625}{4}}\big]  \\
  \amp    =10094\left({\frac{1}{9}}\right)\pi\big({\frac{375}{4}}\big) \\
 \amp  \approx 330325\;\;\text{J}
\end{array}
